## Smart Window Sidebar Auto-Open Pref

smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-title = 想要到保持那助手关闭?
smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-body = 你能仍然打开它每当你需要它.
smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-accept = 是, 保持关闭
smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-dismiss = 无谢意
smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-accepted-title = 那助手将制止关闭
smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-accepted-subtitle = 使用询问到打开它在任何的页. 更改这任何时候在 <a data-l10n-name="settings">设置</a>.
smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-rejected-title = 获得它
smartwindow-sidebar-auto-open-callout-rejected-subtitle = 如果你更改你的思想, 你能更新那默认在 <a data-l10n-name="settings">设置</a> 任何时候.
